1
00:00:00,505 --> 00:00:02,905
(ringing)

2
00:00:02,907 --> 00:00:04,537
(Amy:)Oh, uh, ok...

3
00:00:04,542 --> 00:00:07,612
(Amy:)Uh, here's our first call.

4
00:00:07,612 --> 00:00:10,082
(Sheldon:)Hello, and welcome
to Fun With Flags.

5
00:00:10,081 --> 00:00:11,711
(Amy:)What's your question?

6
00:00:11,716 --> 00:00:13,286
KOOTHRAPPALI:
What is wrong with me?

7
00:00:13,284 --> 00:00:15,484
(Raj(voice):)Why am I so self-destructive?

8
00:00:17,489 --> 00:00:18,959
(Amy:)Rajesh?

9
00:00:18,957 --> 00:00:23,457
(Sheldon:)Yes.

10
00:00:23,461 --> 00:00:26,091
(Raj:)You two look happy...
how do you do it?

11
00:00:26,097 --> 00:00:27,037
I-I think it starts
with good communication.

12
00:00:27,037 --> 00:00:30,127
Yeah, wait, that's not a flag
question. Next caller.

13
00:00:32,704 --> 00:00:35,334
(Howard:)I hope you don't think
I'm just saying this

14
00:00:35,340 --> 00:00:37,870
(Howard:)because it's
Valentine's Day, but...

15
00:00:37,876 --> 00:00:39,846
(Howard:)I love you so much.

16
00:00:39,844 --> 00:00:42,074
(Bernadette:)I'm gonna put this
down your robe.

17
00:00:44,849 --> 00:00:47,219
(Bernadette:)It's not moving,
but I think it's still alive.

18
00:00:47,218 --> 00:00:50,518
(Howard:)Well, should we put it back
in there a few minutes?

19
00:00:51,589 --> 00:00:53,189
(Leonard:)No.

20
00:00:53,191 --> 00:00:56,021
(Bernadette:)No, and it's not a rat,
it's a rabbit.

